  'Best DUI/OWI Attorney in Ann Arbor',
  '#1 DUI/OWI Attorney',
  'Best Felony Attorney',
  "Washtenaw County's Best Criminal Defense Attorney",
  'Top-Rated Criminal Defense Attorney',
  'Best Domestic Violence Defense Attorney',
