        <div class="eyebrow" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/best-criminal-defense-attorney-washtenaw-county.astro:y7peoz">Best Criminal Defense Attorney in Washtenaw County?</div>
        <h1 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/best-criminal-defense-attorney-washtenaw-county.astro:a0mv8d">"The Best Criminal Defense Attorney in Washtenaw County"</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/best-criminal-defense-attorney-washtenaw-county.astro:qj9thj">How Can I Trust Who The Best Criminal Defense Attorney For My Case Is?</p>
        <p class="hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/best-criminal-defense-attorney-washtenaw-county.astro:qj9thk">By Peer &amp; Client Reviews, Independent Ratings &amp; Case Results. Joe Simon Named a Michigan Top 10 Criminal Defense Attorney, Super Lawyer and Lawyer of the Year.</p>
