        <p class="text-[18.08px] leading-[31px] text-[#C3CCDA] max-w-[680px] mx-auto mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/best-criminal-defense-attorney-washtenaw-county.astro:qj9tia">Your consultation is confidential and available 24/7. Tell us what you're facing and we'll explain how Michigan law applies to it.</p>
